## Regional

- [Was gibt es Neues bei dbt + Fivetran (Germany)](https://www.getdbt.com/de/resources/webinars/dbt-neues-de.md): Wir haben im Juni die Fusion von Fivetran + dbt Labs bekannt gegeben – und vier bahnbrechende Neuerungen vorgestellt.
- [Démo en direct de la dbt platform – France (France)](https://www.getdbt.com/fr/resources/webinars/demo-en-direct-de-la-dbt-platform-france.md): Regardez une démonstration en direct d'une heure de la dbt platform
- [Demo dal vivo di dbt platform – Italia (Italy)](https://www.getdbt.com/it/resources/webinars/demo-dal-vivo-di-dbt-platform-italia.md): Guarda una demo dal vivo di un'ora sulla dbt platform
- [dbt Labs 日本 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp.md): dbt Labs は、ガバナンスの行き届いたデータパイプラインでデータ品質を向上。分析と AI 活用を加速し、運用の効率化とクラウドコストの最適化を同時に実現します。
- [dbt Labsについて (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/about-us.md): dbt は、データアナリストやエンジニアがクラウドデータウェアハウスでデータを変換、テスト、文書化できるデータ変換ツールです。
- [Blog Index Page (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/blog.md): dbt Labs ディスクリプション：アナリティクスエンジニアリングの最新トレンド、dbtの活用事例、業界インサイトをお届けします。
- [株式会社テレシー dbt 導入事例：AIとdbt platformで実現する 「AI-readyなデータ基盤」 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/blog/case-study-telecy.md)
- [dbt Semantic Layer vs. Text-to-SQL：2026年ベンチマーク最新版 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/blog/semantic-layer-vs-text-to-sql-2026.md): セマンティックレイヤーとText-to-SQLの違いを徹底比較。2026年のデータ活用において、どちらのアプローチがビジネスに適しているかを解説します。
- [dbt アナリティクスエンジニアリング認定試験 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/certifications/analytics-engineer-certification-exam.md): dbtを活用したデータモデリング・テスト・最適化のスキルを証明する認定試験。SQLの基礎知識とdbt実務経験6ヶ月以上の方に最適。オンラインで受験可能、合格後すぐに認定証を取得できます。
- [dbt アーキテクト認定試験 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/certifications/dbt-architect-certification-exam.md): 安全でスケーラブルなdbt環境の設計スキルを証明する認定試験。環境管理・RBAC・dbt Mesh・ジョブ設定などを評価。オンラインで受験可能、合格後すぐに認定証を取得できます。
- [dbtのエキスパートに相談 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/contact.md): dbt platformのライブデモを体験しませんか？専門スタッフがご質問にお答えし、データ品質の向上・開発効率化・AI活用の加速をどう実現できるかをご説明します
- [dbt認定資格 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/dbt-certifications.md): dbt認定資格でアナリティクスエンジニアとしてのスキルを証明しましょう。アナリティクスエンジニアリング試験とアーキテクト試験の2種類を提供。オンライン受験可能、日本語対応。
- [dbt platform (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/dbt-platform.md): dbt platformは、データ変換・テスト・デプロイを一元管理するマネージドサービスです。チームの生産性を高め、信頼性の高いデータパイプラインを構築しましょう。
- [dbt Labs - Home (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/home.md): dbtは、生データを整理・検証し、アナリティクス・ダッシュボード・AIが使える信頼できるデータに変換するプラットフォームです。世界8万チーム以上に選ばれ、データ品質の向上・コスト削減・AI活用を同時に実現します。
- [モダンなデータ開発プロセス (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/modern-data-transformation.md): dbtは ELTプロセスにおけるデータ変換を効率化し、エラーを削減。 モダンなデータ開発環境で、チームの生産性を最大化します。
- [Product - dbt (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/product/dbt.md): ソフトウェアエンジニアリングの手法をデータ分析に取り入れ、いかなる複雑なデータの管理を可能にします。チームの能力を最大限に引き出す、dbt プラットフォームの構成要素をご紹介します。
- [Product - Fusion (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/product/fusion.md): モダンなアナリティクス基盤のために設計された次世代エンジン、dbt Fusion。 超高速パフォーマンスと高度なSQLバリデーションを提供します。
- [dbtとは (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/product/what-is-dbt.md): dbtは、ソフトウェアエンジニアリングのベストプラクティスをデータ変換に取り入れ、信頼性の高いデータプロダクトを構築できるツールです。自動テスト・バージョン管理・ドキュメント化により、データチームの開発効率を最大化します。
- [dbtプロダクトアップデート2026 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/resources/webinars/dbt-product-update-2026.md): dbtプロダクトアップデート2026ウェビナー。dbt Core v2.0、Fusion、dbt State、dbt Wizard について、日本語でわかりやすく解説します
- [登録 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/signup.md): 個人開発者は永久無料、チームは14日間無料トライアルでdbt platformをお試しいただけます。すぐにセットアップして、信頼性の高いデータパイプラインの構築を始めましょう。
- [2026年 アナリティクスエンジニアリング最新動向 (Japan)](https://www.getdbt.com/jp/state-of-analytics-engineering-2026.md): 2026年のアナリティクスエンジニアリングの最新動向を網羅したレポート。業界のトレンド、ツール、キャリアパスを詳しく解説します

## Optional

- [Understanding data compression](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-compression.md): Discover how compression improves query performance and cuts storage costs in modern data warehouses.
- [Understanding data backup and recovery](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-backup-and-recovery.md): Learn the fundamentals of data backup and recovery to protect your valuable information from loss.
- [Understanding query optimization](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-query-optimization.md): Learn essential techniques and benefits of query optimization to speed up execution, reduce costs, and improve performance.
- [Understanding data indexing](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-indexing.md): Learn how data indexing speeds up database queries, improves read performance, and the trade-offs involved.
- [Understanding data partitioning](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-partitioning.md): Learn the key concepts and benefits of data partitioning for improved performance, scalability, and efficiency.
- [Understanding change data capture](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-change-data-capture.md): Learn what Change Data Capture (CDC) is, how it works, and why it's essential for real-time data sync.
- [Understanding data replication](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-replication.md): Learn the fundamentals of data replication, its types, benefits like disaster recovery, and best practices.
- [Understanding schema management](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-schema-management.md): Learn the essentials of schema management, how TIBCO applications use schema data, and schema basics.
- [Understanding data validation](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-validation.md): Learn what data validation is, why it's crucial for data integrity, and the different types of validation rules.
- [Understanding data enrichment](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-enrichment.md): Learn what data enrichment is, why it's important, and how it can help with compliance and data governance.
- [Understanding data cleansing](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-cleansing.md): Learn the essential steps of data cleansing: identifying errors, fixing incorrect and incomplete data, and removing duplicates.
- [Understanding data profiling](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-profiling.md): Learn what data profiling is, how it evaluates data quality, identifies patterns, and prepares data for analytics.
- [Understanding data discovery](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-discovery.md): Learn what data discovery is, how it works, and why it is essential for business optimization.
- [Understanding data compliance](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-compliance.md): Learn the essentials of data compliance, including PII protection, regionalization, and avoiding costly fines.
- [Understanding data privacy](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-privacy.md): Learn about the importance of data privacy, how your information is used, and ways to protect your data.
- [Understanding data security](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-security.md): Learn the fundamentals of data security, including best practices, threats, and how to protect your information.
- [Understanding cloud data warehouses](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-cloud-data-warehouses.md): Learn about cloud data warehouses, their key capabilities, top services (BigQuery, Snowflake, Redshift), and benefits.
- [Understanding data architecture](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-architecture.md): Learn about data architecture, its components, models (conceptual, logical, physical), and frameworks.
- [Understanding master data management](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-master-data-management.md): Learn why Master Data Management (MDM) is crucial for data accuracy, consistency, and decision-making.
- [Understanding data federation](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-federation.md): Learn what data federation is, how it works, and its importance for real-time data access and cost efficiency.
- [Understanding data virtualization](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-virtualization.md): Data virtualization provides fast access to data across sources without moving or copying it. Learn the key concepts.
- [Understanding real-time analytics](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-real-time-analytics.md): Please provide the title of the post so I can write the meta description.
- [Understanding batch processing](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-batch-processing.md): Discover the fundamentals of batch processing: what it is, how it works, and its impact on performance.
- [Understanding data streaming](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-streaming.md): Learn the fundamentals of data streaming: how real-time data movement and processing work in modern systems.
- [Understanding reverse ETL](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-reverse-etl.md): Learn how Reverse ETL syncs trusted data from your warehouse into CRMs, marketing platforms, and support systems.
- [Understanding data fabric](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-fabric.md): Learn how data fabric unifies data, automates governance, and enables self-service data access at scale.
- [Understanding data mesh](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-mesh.md): Learn the definition, principles, benefits, and challenges of data mesh architecture for decentralized data.
- [Understanding DataOps](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-dataops.md): Learn the core principles and practices of DataOps to deliver high-quality, reliable data faster and more efficiently.
- [Understanding data observability](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-observability.md): Learn the definition of data observability, its benefits, and the key pillars (metrics, metadata, lineage, logs).
- [Understanding metadata management](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-metadata-management.md): Learn what metadata management is, why it's critical for data quality and governance, and best practices.
- [Understanding data catalogs](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-catalogs.md): Discover what a data catalog is, its benefits for data discovery, governance, and self-service analytics.
- [Understanding business intelligence](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-business-intelligence.md): Learn how Business Intelligence (BI) uses data and analytics to drive informed decision-making and optimize operations.
- [Understanding data marts](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-marts.md): Learn what data marts are, how they differ from data warehouses, and the benefits for specific business units.
- [Understanding data lakes](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-lakes.md): Discover how data lakes handle all data types, enabling machine learning and advanced analytics use cases.
- [Understanding ETL processes](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-etl-processes.md): Learn the essentials of ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) processes for better data management.
- [Understanding data pipelines](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-pipelines.md): Learn about data pipelines: how they extract, transform, and load data to support business intelligence and analysis.
- [Understanding data modeling](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-modeling.md): Learn the essentials of data modeling, including its purpose, components, and how it structures data effectively.
- [Understanding agentic analytics](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-agentic-analytics.md): Unlock autonomous data analysis and decision-making. Learn what agentic analytics is and how it works.
- [Understanding data lineage](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-lineage.md): How data lineage transforms data from source to destination, and why it is critical for compliance, quality, and analytics.
- [Understanding data quality](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-quality.md): Learn what data quality means for your organization, why it matters, and how to maintain high standards.
- [Understanding data transformation](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-transformation.md): Learn what data transformation is, why it's essential, and how to effectively apply it in your projects.
- [Understanding analytics engineering](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-analytics-engineering.md): Learn what analytics engineering is, the skills needed, and how it bridges the gap between data and analysis.
- [Understanding enterprise data warehouses](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-enterprise-data-warehouses.md): Learn the essentials of enterprise data warehouses (EDW), a centralized system for organizational data analysis.
- [Understanding data orchestration](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-orchestration.md): Learn what data orchestration is, how it unifies data, improves efficiency, and drives informed decisions.
- [Understanding data ingestion](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-ingestion.md): Learn the tools, processes, and methods (batch, real-time, lambda) for collecting and moving data to a target site.
- [Understanding data integration](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-integration.md): Learn the fundamentals of data integration, why it's crucial for business intelligence, and best practices.
- [Understanding data warehouses](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-data-warehouses.md): Learn the basics of data warehouses, including metadata, ETL processes, and how they support business analytics.
- [Understanding the semantic layer](https://www.getdbt.com/discover/understanding-the-semantic-layer.md): Translate raw data into business meaning for consistency, governance, and better AI results with a semantic layer.
